  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.8: Context-overflow rejections are translated through AIHttpErrorFactory, raising ContextLengthExceededException so the reactive recovery released in Mythosia.AI v6.8.0 engages for Qwen and for vLLM deployments served through this provider. QwenService owns its own HTTP error path, so recovery could not reach it otherwise. No API changes. Requires Mythosia.AI v6.8.0.",
